    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-num10">
        <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e98">Caput 10</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0399C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_2@1-5">Fac tibi duas tubas argenteas,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e112" ref="#IsidoreOfSeville">ISID.</name>, in Num.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e116"><seg type="qs">Per duas tubas exercitus ducitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">auditorum mentes ad tentationum certamina ardentius excitantur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e125">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e127">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e129">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e131" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_4@1-3">Si semel clangueris.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e134"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e135" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name>, in Num.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e139"><seg type="qs">Semel tubis clangere</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et id ipsum dicant omnes in eodem sensu et in eadem scientia.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e150">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_5@10-10">Primi.</quote>
            Quia scilicet lux fidei primum infulsit. Ordinatis ergo Evangelii praedicatoribus, primum eis dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e157" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt10_6@1-9">In viam gentium ne abieritis, sed ite ad oves quae perierunt domus Israel</quote>: quibus ipse Christus scilicet praesentialiter Evangelium praedicavit. Post resurrectionem vero discipulis apparens ait: <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e160" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt28_19@1-5">Euntes docete omnes gentes,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(Matth. XVIII)</note>-->. Tribus ergo Juda cum caeteris quae <pb ed="#P" n="0399D"/> secum ad orientem habitabant, primum castra movebat: deinde caeterae secundum ordinem suum. Quia primum in Judaea oportuit primitivam Ecclesiam construi, post de cunctis orbis nationibus gentes ad fidem convocari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e169">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e171">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e173">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e175" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_7@1-3">Quando autem congregandus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e178"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e179" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e182"><seg type="qs">In convocatione populi</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nihil enim quaerimus, nisi ut pateat quod clausum est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e194">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_8">Filii autem.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Praedicatores, scilicet verbum Dei praedicant, et viam justitiae auditoribus demonstrant, ut in semita mandatorum Dei boni operis gressum ponant, et iter impiorum fugiant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e204">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e206" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_8@4-5">Clangent tubis.</quote>
            Subditos, scilicet ad poenitentiam et ad compunctionem lacrymarum excitando, et <pb ed="#P" n="0400A"/> corda auditorum ad Dei misericordiam implorandam provocando.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e213">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e215">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e217">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e219" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_10@1-4">Si quando habebitis epulum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e222"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e223" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e226"><seg type="qs">Nota quia in adversis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e232" source="http://scta.info/resource/IItim4_2@1-5">Praedica verbum, insta opportune importune,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(I Tim. IV)</note>-->.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e240">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e242">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e244">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e246" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_11@1-2">Anno secundo.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e249"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e250" ref="#Jerome">HIERON.</name>, epist. ad Fabiolam, tom. I.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e254"><seg type="qs">Duodecima mansione venerunt filii Israel in desertum Sinai</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">intus autem plena sunt ossibus mortuorum, et omni spurcitia.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e262">
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e264" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/num10_11@1-2"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e266"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e267" ref="#GregoryGreat">GREG.</name>, Pastoralis parte III, admon. 18.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e271"><seg type="qs">Plerumque suadere elatis utilia melius possemus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">inde se verbis exnortantis inclinaret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e280">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e282">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e284">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e286" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_23">Arcaque foederis.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-num10-Rd1e291"><name xml:id="gom-num10-Nd1e292" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e295"><seg type="qs">Arca foederis <pb ed="#P" n="0400B"/> Domini</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">callem veritatis et justitiae sequentibus demonstrat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e306">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e308">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e310">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e312" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_34@1-2">Nubes quoque.</quote>
            Protectio divina, quae Spiritus sancti gratia electos ab initio mundi defendit, et ad futuram quietem custodit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-num10-Dd1e317">
          <head xml:id="gom-num10-Hd1e319">Versus 35</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-num10-d1e321">
            <quote xml:id="gom-num10-Qd1e323" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/num10_35@1-2">Cumque elevaretur.</quote>
            Exemplo Mosis rectores plebis provocantur, ut semper solliciti commissum sibi gregem in principio operis, et in consummatione, Domino commendent, ut proprias oves protegat et inimicos depellat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
